{ia9}{arial}{offset110}

From: {arialbld}Mayumi Bazuka{arial}

To: Commander Tyron Spirex

Copy: {rank} {name}{offset0}







Dear T-Rex,

Not wishing to offend you Commander, I've found a major flaw in your TSUNAMI plan: your next objectives will lead you deep into the Katzar interior and I'm curious to know how you're going to transport your aircraft carriers across the Katzar steppes?{pause}

Like your father General Theodore Spirex you are a great strategist and you know perfectly well that without the cover of my "Zenzen" super fighters, your slower "Kormorans" fall like flies in the face of the Paranos' "Yak" fighters.{pause}

I'm not anymore a girly and no-one here is more qualified than I am to save your TSUNAMI plan from catastrophe.{pause}

Here's the plan I propose:

Tomorrow I will be in the front lines at {arialbld}Kalimatan{arial}.
My plan is to take my mid-sized tanks through the Kokand pass for a surprise attack on the {arialbld}Mozdok{arial} and {arialbld}Kara Bagaz{arial} mining facilities. You Commander T-Rex and you {rank} {name} will take advantage of my diversion to land together in the south on the coast of Kara Bagaz. This double-whammy will allow you to capture Yorik's base, and then charge towards the east to fall on his back at the Kokand. From our side we'll hold them down as long as possible, but if you're late we'll be crushed under their sheer numbers.{pause}

With Yorik annihilated we can push together towards the east to Mozdok, where is entrenched the camp of {arialbld}Fedor Kharkan{arial}!{pause}

{ia2}{offset95}He's a serious customer, on attack his troops are forbidden to retreat, under pain of being massacred by his rear guard.{pause}

The scar on his face did not come from a knife duel for the supreme title. It's the work of a wolf which, Fedor Kharkan, on a dare, bet he'd kill with his bare hands. The wolf bit his face while eating his right eye. By reflex Kharkan seized the beast ferociously by the neck and pierced his throat with his teeth.{offset0}


See you then,

Mayumi BZK.


{micro}---------------------
Cap. Imperial Fanato Air Force
Base of Kalimatan
